      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260714142927.1298897-15-jiri@resnulli.us/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260714142927.1298897-15-jiri@resnulli.us/mbox/",
      "hash": "842555c095a1886305dc3e18db800d98cf6c63d7",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Jiri Pirko",
      "date": "2026-07-14T14:29:27",
      "summary": "该补丁为 RDMA 子系统新增一个 kselftest 测试脚本 rxe_netns_names.sh，用于验证 RXE（软件 RDMA 设备）在不同网络命名空间（netns）下的设备命名行为。测试场景包括跨命名空间的重复名称处理、设备移动时的冲突处理、带重命名的移动操作以及同一命名空间内的重命名请求。同时更新了 RDMA selftests 的 Makefile 和 config 文件，加入 CONFIG_DUMMY 和 CONFIG_NET_NS 依赖。该改动属于网络栈外围的测试增强，主要涉及网络命名空间与 RDMA 设备标识的交互，对内核网络行为验证有意义但非核心协议栈变更。",
      "tags": [
        "Linux内核网络",
        "驱动",
        "性能"
      ],
      "relevance": "medium",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14686701,
      "title": "[rdma-next,v2,08/14] RDMA/cgroup: Disambiguate devices across net namespaces",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260714142927.1298897-9-jiri@resnulli.us",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260714142927.1298897-9-jiri@resnulli.us/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260714142927.1298897-9-jiri@resnulli.us/mbox/",
      "hash": "9b60df775b26e35b504b9d05654ea981b3c8f481",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Jiri Pirko",
      "date": "2026-07-14T14:29:21",
      "summary": "该补丁针对 RDMA cgroup 控制器中跨网络命名空间的设备命名歧义问题。RDMA 设备名仅在同一 netns 内唯一，但 RDMA cgroup 可管控来自多个命名空间的设备，导致 cgroup 输出混乱且写入限制时可能选错设备。方案是引入系统级 RDMA 设备索引（index=N），对同名设备进行消歧：全局唯一名称保持原有 UAPI 不变，重名时强制要求指定索引，纯名称的歧义写入返回 -ENOTUNIQ。同时在文档中说明新语法（如 \"rxe0 index=5 hca_handle=2\"），并修改 cgroup/rdma.c 与 drivers/infiniband/core/cgroup.c 以支持该机制。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "容器网络",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "medium",
      "readingTime": 4
    },
    {
      "id": 14686631,
      "title": "[v3,net,2/6] xsk: drain continuation descs after overflow in xsk_build_skb()",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260714140722.111645-3-maciej.fijalkowski@intel.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260714140722.111645-3-maciej.fijalkowski@intel.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260714140722.111645-3-maciej.fijalkowski@intel.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "86807bb7232c670bfe79b79da69f2b4c04ebcde4",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Maciej Fijalkowski",
      "date": "2026-07-14T14:07:18",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 AF_XDP generic xmit 路径在多缓冲区（multi-buffer）Tx 处理中的资源泄漏问题。当分片报文描述符数量超过 MAX_SKB_FRAGS，或分片中包含非法描述符时，剩余的描述符此前会被静默丢弃无法回收。新增 xdp_sock::drain_cont 标志位，在溢出发生时持续消费 Tx 环上的描述符并通过新增的 xsk_cq_submit_addr_single_locked 辅助函数将它们直接放入 CQ，从而保证用户态能够正确回收这些描述符。该修复完善了 AF_XDP 多缓冲区 Tx 路径的健壮性，避免了描述符泄漏。",
      "tags": [
        "XDP",
        "包处理",
        "性能"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14686630,
      "title": "[v3,net,1/6] xsk: fix buffer leak in xsk_drop_skb() for AF_XDP multi-buffer Tx",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260714140722.111645-2-maciej.fijalkowski@intel.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260714140722.111645-2-maciej.fijalkowski@intel.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260714140722.111645-2-maciej.fijalkowski@intel.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "925ed292f0afa959ac2518f8e237e3213ec7bc24",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Maciej Fijalkowski",
      "date": "2026-07-14T14:07:17",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 AF_XDP 多缓冲区发送路径中 xsk_drop_skb() 导致的缓冲区泄漏问题。在三种丢弃部分构建的多缓冲 skb 的场景下（xsk_build_skb 的 -EOVERFLOW 路径、__xsk_generic_xmit 循环清理、xsk_release 关闭 socket），虽然已通过 xskq_cons_release 消费了 TX 描述符并预留了 CQ 槽位，但 xsk_drop_skb() 调用的 xsk_consume_skb() 会通过 xsk_cq_cancel_locked() 取消 CQ 预留，导致缓冲区地址永远不会出现在完成队列中，用户态永久丢失这些缓冲区。修复方法是将 xsk_consume_skb() 改为 consume_skb()，触发已有的 xsk_destruct_skb 析构函数（通过 xsk_cq_submit_addr_locked() 提交缓冲区地址），同时显式设置 xs->skb = NULL，并在 xsk_build_skb() 中保存最后一个描述符地址以确保所有片段地址被正确提交。",
      "tags": [
        "XDP",
        "驱动",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 4
    },
    {
      "id": 14686306,
      "title": "[net] ipv4: require matching source address for route hint reuse",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260714122618.21698-1-zhaoyz24@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260714122618.21698-1-zhaoyz24@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260714122618.21698-1-zhaoyz24@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn/mbox/",
      "hash": "9dac5a6e041940a45a06ad2c2dbe1863c019cccf",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Yizhou Zhao",
      "date": "2026-07-14T12:26:17",
      "summary": "该补丁修复 IPv4 列表接收路径中的路由提示(route hint)复用安全漏洞。原先 ip_can_use_hint() 仅比较目的地址和 TOS 即复用前一 skb 的 dst，对于转发路由会跳过 fib_validate_source()，导致不同源地址的报文可绕过严格 rp_filter 源地址校验。补丁在复用条件中新增源地址匹配（ip_hdr(hint)->saddr == iph->saddr），确保仅同源/同目的/同 TOS 的报文走快速路径，源地址变化的报文回归正常路由查找与源校验流程，从而修复严格反向路径过滤被绕过的安全问题。",
      "tags": [
        "TCP/IP",
        "包处理",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14686106,
      "title": "[net,v2] ila: reload IPv6 header after pskb_may_pull in checksum adjust",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260714114903.3763420-1-michael.bommarito@gmail.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260714114903.3763420-1-michael.bommarito@gmail.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260714114903.3763420-1-michael.bommarito@gmail.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "af304a5671969848e8cdf98451c67e06d92309e7",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Michael Bommarito",
      "date": "2026-07-14T11:49:03",
      "summary": "修复 IPv6 ILA（Identifier Locator Addressing）子系统中 `ila_csum_adjust_transport()` 与 `ila_update_ipv6_locator()` 的 use-after-free 漏洞。原代码在调用 `pskb_may_pull()` 之前缓存了 `ip6h = ipv6_hdr(skb)`，但对于非线性 skb，`pskb_may_pull()` 可能触发 `__pskb_pull_tail()` / `pskb_expand_head()` 释放旧 skb 头部，使缓存的 `ip6h` 成为悬空指针，后续 `get_csum_diff()` 及写入新 locator 的操作会读取已释放内存（KASAN 报告 slab-use-after-free）。修复方案是在每次 `pskb_may_pull()` 之后重新加载 `ip6h`，并在 `ila_update_ipv6_locator()` 的 `ILA_CSUM_ADJUST_TRANSPORT` 分支中单独重载 `ip6h` 和 `iaddr`，而 neutral-map 模式不 pull skb 故保留缓存指针不变。该问题影响经过配置 ILA csum-adjust-transport 路由或接收端映射的所有 IPv6 数据包，触发无需认证但路由/映射配置需 CAP_NET_ADMIN。",
      "tags": [
        "TCP/IP",
        "包处理",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14685598,
