      "id": 14678106,
      "title": "[08/10] xfrm: iptfs: propagate SKBFL_SHARED_FRAG in iptfs_skb_add_frags()",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260710090349.343389-9-steffen.klassert@secunet.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260710090349.343389-9-steffen.klassert@secunet.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260710090349.343389-9-steffen.klassert@secunet.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "15c1c1215613f30743d58268883f29a6c7886298",
      "commitRef": "430ea57d6daf765e88f90046afbfd1e071cb7200",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Steffen Klassert",
      "date": "2026-07-10T09:03:21",
      "summary": "该补丁修复 XFRM 子系统下 IPTFS（IP Traffic Flow Security）功能中 iptfs_skb_add_frags() 函数未正确传递 SKBFL_SHARED_FRAG 标志位的缺陷。当源 SKB 携带共享 frag（如 page-pool 接收路径产生的），拷贝到内部 SKB 时若不标记 shared 状态，ESP 解密的 esp_input() 会走 no-COW 快速路径原地写解密数据，而外层 IPTFS SKB 仍引用这些页面，造成内存破坏甚至内核 panic。补丁在循环内 __skb_frag_ref() 后无条件设置 SKBFL_SHARED_FRAG，与内核其它 frag 传递辅助函数（skb_try_coalesce、skb_segment 等）保持一致。",
      "tags": [
        "Linux内核网络",
        "包处理",
        "性能"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
