      "id": 14678105,
      "title": "[01/10] xfrm: propagate -EINPROGRESS from validate_xmit_xfrm()",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260710090349.343389-2-steffen.klassert@secunet.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260710090349.343389-2-steffen.klassert@secunet.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260710090349.343389-2-steffen.klassert@secunet.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "8129b79cc79de9b7bceca10c3bb875ace81075db",
      "commitRef": "6860b467f569f732b11cbc588ae7e195e90e7e23",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Steffen Klassert",
      "date": "2026-07-10T09:03:14",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 XFRM（IPsec）异步加密场景下返回值语义混乱的问题。validate_xmit_xfrm() 原本对\"丢包\"和\"被异步加密盗用（-EINPROGRESS）\"都返回 NULL，调用者无法区分，导致 __dev_queue_xmit() 在虚拟/网桥设备（noqueue qdisc）上错误地将已被异步接管、稍后通过 xfrm_dev_resume() 投递的 skb 判为 ENOMEM 失败。改动包括：validate_xmit_xfrm() 在异步场景改回 ERR_PTR(-EINPROGRESS)；__dev_queue_xmit() 检测到 -EINPROGRESS 时返回 NET_XMIT_SUCCESS；validate_xmit_skb_list() 使用 IS_ERR_OR_NULL() 避免误将错误指针加入传输列表。",
      "tags": [
        "包处理",
        "路由",
        "性能"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14676481,
      "title": "[bpf-next,v3,1/2] bpf: Require a BPF cpumask for bpf_cpumask_populate()",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260709182800.2037938-2-main.kalliope@gmail.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260709182800.2037938-2-main.kalliope@gmail.com/",
